# JOURNEY · the toybox: a Toyfish is a toy you dress. Open /toybox, step into a toy's slots and back
# out without saving, then read the shelf. Parts only come from the Claw, which no journey can win on
# cue, so the toy is handed over in a debug blink and the journey checks every door of the box.

clear
include scenes/take-a-fish.play toyfish Pip
run /toybox
expect Toybox
expect Pip
expect ENTER dress up
snap the toy beside its name
key enter
expect Toybox#edit
expect Head
expect Tail
expect ENTER save
key down
key down
snap the slots of a toy
key esc
absent Toybox#edit
key tab
expect Toybox#shelf
expect Colors
expect ???
snap the shelf keeps what was never won dark
key tab
expect Toybox
key esc
absent Toybox
